      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02406",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "苗子摇摇头。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Naeko shook her head.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02406",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "千重子抓住红格子门，目送苗子远去。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Chieko grasped the red lattice door and watched Naeko go off into the distance.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02406",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "苗子始终没有回头。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Naeko never once looked back.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02406",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "在千重子的前发上飘落了少许细雪，很快就消融了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A little fine snow drifted down onto Chieko's bangs and quickly melted away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02406",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "整个市街也还在沉睡着。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The whole city street was still asleep as well.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
